WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
See the record. Read the story. Choose a range and read what was actually recorded.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.167
Open Insights. Choose Insights in the desktop sidebar.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.683
Choose a range. Switch from today to the last seven days.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:09.683
Read the measured outcomes. Charts show the record, never a productivity score.

00:00:09.683 --> 00:00:11.883
A record, not a score. Observed context stays separate from outcomes.
